WEBVTT

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.581
Because I'm going to tell you
what you're doing."

00:21:31.605 --> 00:21:33.754
He said, "You're beating
the drum for justice.

00:21:33.778 --> 00:21:35.637
You keep beating the drum for justice."

00:21:35.661 --> 00:21:36.812
And I was so moved.

00:21:36.836 --> 00:21:37.999
I was also relieved,

00:21:38.023 --> 00:21:40.491
because I just didn't know
what was about to happen.

00:21:40.515 --> 00:21:42.960
But then he said, "Come here,
come here, come here."

00:21:42.984 --> 00:21:46.125
And he pulled me by my jacket,
and he pulled me down close to him,

00:21:46.149 --> 00:21:47.911
and he turned his head, and he said,

00:21:47.935 --> 00:21:50.610
"You see this scar I have
right here behind my right ear?

00:21:50.634 --> 00:21:53.530
I got that scar in Greene
County, Alabama, in 1963,

00:21:53.554 --> 00:21:54.886
working with C.T. Vivian."

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:56.419
JL: Yeah, Greene County.

00:21:56.443 --> 00:21:57.800
BS: Then he turned his head.

00:21:57.824 --> 00:21:59.610
He said, "You see this cut down here?

00:21:59.634 --> 00:22:02.155
I got that in Philadelphia, Mississippi